WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
Building the Sukkah does not require inventing

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.400
a construction blessing.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.520
Enjoy finishing preparation.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.380
An immediate positive feeling can encourage action

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.320
without creating a new religious practice.
